{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/lobaxgva","slide":1,"name":"experiment","text":"先用同样的噪声水平 16 和 17 训练 H gate 与 S gate；再对 S gate 扫描训练 error probability，并在无噪声和 1PE 环境下测试 AFE。","textPreview":"先用同样的噪声水平 16 和 17 训练 H gate 与 S gate；再对 S gate 扫描训练 error probability，并在无噪声和 1PE 环境下测试 AFE。","textChars":91,"textLines":1,"bbox":[72,271,1090,44]}
